# Source files that must never be deployed to the home directory.
#
# Anything in the source root without a leading dot becomes a target: without
# these lines chezmoi would write ~/README.md, ~/LICENSE.txt, ~/sshd-mac.conf
# and a whole ~/certification directory. Dot-prefixed source entries
# (.gitattributes, .githooks, .chezmoiscripts, .chezmoi.toml.tmpl) are ignored
# by chezmoi automatically.

**/*.plist.base
bootstrap.sh
certification
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE.txt
README.md
sshd-mac.conf
